# TIDES (SHAPE's last page): its RATE, how far it moves the DRONE, the SPACE and VOX, ALGO its SHAPE (even ..
# wandering); DRONE 2 (the drone's own movement: RATE, SWEEP, WIDTH, DRIFT). Pushed all the way, a short
# tide sweeps the sound without a click or a clip. SEL twice puts a page back as made. Audio in tides.wav.
wait 500
tap ENV
turn SELECT 7
expect page 7
turn K1 -40
expect tide0 0
turn ALGO -40
expect tide4 0
turn K2 60
turn K3 60
turn K4 60
expect tide1 127
expect tide3 120
shot tides.png
wav tides.wav
tapkey w4
wait 2000
tapkey w6
wait 14000
wavstop
expect tide_now >-101
expect tide_now <101
expect clips 0
tap SEL
tap SEL
wait 100
expect tide0 64
expect tide1 24
expect tide3 0
turn SELECT -6
expect page 1
turn K1 -20
turn K2 30
shot drone2.png
expect dmotion0 1
expect dmotion1 85
tap SEL
tap SEL
wait 100
expect dmotion0 41
expect dmotion1 25
expect clips 0
